  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-21" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;Trevor I Mihalik elected as Vice President, Chief Financial Officer and Director effective on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:63pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;01/20/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:63pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;Christen M Blend elected as Secretary effective on 03/15/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:63pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:63pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Franz D. Messner, elected as Assistant treasurer effective on 04/12/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Marc B. Hunter, elected as Assistant treasurer effective on 04/12/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;David R. Ball, elected as Vice President effective on 05/21/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Kamran Ali, elected as Vice President effective on 05/21/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Douglas A. Cannon, elected as Vice President effective on 06/11/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Robert B. Berntsen, elected as Vice President, Director effective on 07/14/2025 and as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;secretary effective on 08/30/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Heather M. Whitney, elected as Chief Accounting Officer, Controller effective on 08/02/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Ryan J. Forbes elected as Vice President effective on 08/30/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Douglas. Wlodarski elected as Assistance Vice President - Tax effective on 08/26/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Christian T Beam resigned as Vice President effective on 01/17/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Charles E Zebula resigned as Vice President, Chief Financial Officer and Director effective on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;01/19/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;David M Feinberg resigned as Secretary effective on 03/14/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Dana M Koenig resigned as Assistant Vice President - Tax effective on 03/22/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Noah K Hollis resigned as Assistant Treasurer effective on 03/28/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Antonio P. Smyth, resigned as Vice President effective on 04/01/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;David M. Feinberg, resigned as Vice President, Director effective on 07/13/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Kate. Sturgess resigned as Chief Accounting Officer, Controller effective on 08/01/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Christen M. Blend resigned as Secretary effective on 08/29/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="f-22" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Proprietary capital ratio exceeds 30%&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-23" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-bottom:24pt;margin-top:24pt;text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;INDEX OF NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Glossary of Terms for Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Organization and Summary of Significant Accounting Policies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;New Accounting Standards &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Rate Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Effects of Regulation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Guarantees and Contingencies &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Benefit Plans &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;7.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Derivatives and Hedging &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;8.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Fair Value Measurements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;9.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.75pt"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;10.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.25pt"&gt;Leases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;11.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.25pt"&gt;Financing Activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;12.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.25pt"&gt;Related Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;13.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.25pt"&gt;Property, Plant and Equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;14.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.25pt"&gt;Revenue from Contracts with Customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:31.5pt;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;15.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:13.25pt"&gt;FERC Order No. 898&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:139%"&gt;GLOSSARY OF TERMS FOR NOTES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:139%"&gt;When the following terms and abbreviations appear in the text of this report, they have the meanings indicated below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:20.179%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.585%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:75.836%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Meaning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:9pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;AEP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:1.5pt;margin-top:2.65pt;padding-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"&gt;American Electric Power Company, Inc., an investor-owned electric public utility holding company which includes American Electric Power Company, Inc. (Parent) and majority owned subsidiaries and affiliates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;AEP Credit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:1.5pt;margin-top:2.65pt;padding-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"&gt;AEP Credit, Inc., a subsidiary of AEP which securitizes accounts receivable and accrued utility revenues for affiliated electric utility companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 1.02pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="colo